  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">미조</span><br><a href=\"https://mizou.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://mizou.com/</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Mizou\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"mizou.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://mizou.com/\" data-og-url=\"https://mizou.com/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://mizou.com/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://mizou.com/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Mizou</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">mizou.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">미조를 지난 1년간 구독하여(올해 11월에 구독마감)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저도 사용하였고, 저희학교 영어과 선생님께서도 같이 함께 사용하셨는데.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 미조라는 챗봇을 따라한 챗봇을 만들어 봤어요</span><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 링크</span></span></b><br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"AI 채팅 학습 도우미\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzgTYXBBOcaIDFxY19rLQWhLKUcGmCXbkdc9znfN0S5PVScp6b5ToWc8Nk_PdsR58eE5A/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">AI 채팅 학습 도우미</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">미조처럼</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생이 AI와 나눈 대화가&#160;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제 구글시트로 다 저장이 실시간으로 됩니다.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">물론 학생들의 채팅창에 작성한 글(질문)에 대한</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">루브릭 평가 구성도 가능합니다.(아직 기능을 넣지 않았지만;;;)</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">테스트 용 아이디&#160;</span></b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 98.2906%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 99.872%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">10반</span></b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">번호</span></b></td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이름</span></b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">19</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">장동건</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">원빈</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">21</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">차승원</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">22</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">현빈</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">23</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">유재석</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">24</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">강호동</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">김희선</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">26</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">이병헌</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 42.8937%; text-align: center;\">27</td><td style=\"width: 56.9782%; text-align: center;\">손예진</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 아이디로 로그인 하실 수 있습니다.</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99309c115bead1fe8a8f5d12b3b4d3566ae3d83f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99309c115bead1fe8a8f5d12b3b4d3566ae3d83f\" data-origin-width=\"712\" data-origin-height=\"790\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5407f2da7ef3b8cfc4f0eb8f146879cba12903ad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5407f2da7ef3b8cfc4f0eb8f146879cba12903ad\" data-origin-width=\"1170\" data-origin-height=\"853\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">챗봇이 반응하는 시간이 다소 오래 걸릴때도 있습니다;;;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
